#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:2
msgid "Addon Packages"
msgstr "Addon Packages"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:7
msgid ""
"Addon Packages extend the functionality of |morpheus| clusters by "
"installing additional software components, services, or capabilities on "
"cluster nodes. Packages are available for MVM (Morpheus Virtual Machine) "
"clusters and provide a plugin-based mechanism to add features such as "
"storage drivers, network plugins, monitoring agents, and other "
"operational tools."
msgstr ""
"Addon Packages extend el functionality de |morpheus| clusters por "
"installing adicional software components, servicios, o capabilities en "
"cluster nodos. Packages están disponibles para MVM (Morpheus Máquina "
"virtual) clusters y proporcionar un plugin-based mechanism a agregar "
"funciones como storage drivers, network plugins, monitoring agents, y "
"otro operational tools."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:9
msgid ""
"Addon Packages are managed at the cluster level and can be installed, "
"configured, upgraded, and removed."
msgstr ""
"Addon Packages son administrado en el cluster nivel y se puede instalar, "
"configurado, upgraded, y eliminado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:12
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:14
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Clusters`` role permission at **Full** level is "
"required to install, update, upgrade, or remove addon packages."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Clusters`` permiso de rol en **Full** nivel es "
"requerido a instalar, update, actualización, o eliminar addon packages."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:15
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Clusters`` role permission at **Read** level allows "
"viewing installed packages only."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Clusters`` permiso de rol en **Read** nivel permite "
"viewing instalado packages solo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:18
msgid "Viewing Installed Packages"
msgstr "Viewing Installed Packages"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:35
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:21
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:36
msgid "Click the name of a Cluster"
msgstr "Click el nombre de un Clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:22
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:37
msgid "Select the **PACKAGES** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **PACKAGES** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:24
msgid "The Packages tab displays all installed addon packages with:"
msgstr "El Packages pestaña muestra todos instalado addon packages con:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:26
msgid "**Name** — Package name"
msgstr "**Name** — Package nombre"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:27
msgid "**Description** — Package description"
msgstr "**Descripción** — Package descripción"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:28
msgid "**Version** — Currently installed version"
msgstr "**Version** — Actualmente instalado versión"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:29
msgid "**Status** — Package status (installed, installing, error)"
msgstr "**Status** — Package estado (instalado, installing, error)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:30
msgid "**Upgradeable** — Indicates if a newer version is available"
msgstr "**Upgradeable** — Indicates si un newer versión está disponible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:33
msgid "Installing an Addon Package"
msgstr "Installing un Addon Package"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:38
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:39
msgid "The Add Package wizard will guide you through two steps:"
msgstr "El Agregar Package wizard será guide you a través de two pasos:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:41
msgid "**Step 1: Select Package Type**"
msgstr "**Step 1: Select Package Type**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:43
msgid ""
"Choose from available package types that are not already installed on the"
" cluster. Only packages compatible with the cluster type (MVM) are shown."
msgstr ""
"Elegir desde disponible package tipos ese son no ya instalado en el "
"cluster. Solo packages compatible con el cluster tipo (MVM) son mostrado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:45
msgid "**Step 2: Configure Package**"
msgstr "**Step 2: Configure Package**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:47
msgid ""
"Configure package-specific settings. The available configuration options "
"depend on the selected package type and may include:"
msgstr ""
"Configure package-específico configuraciones. El disponible configuración"
" opciones depend en el seleccionado package tipo y puede incluir:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:49
msgid "Connection endpoints"
msgstr "Conexión endpoints"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:50
msgid "Authentication credentials"
msgstr "Authentication credentials"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:51
msgid "Resource allocation settings"
msgstr "Recurso allocation configuraciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:52
msgid "Feature toggles"
msgstr "Función toggles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:54
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:54
msgid ""
"Some packages provide custom configuration forms defined by plugin "
"providers. These forms are dynamically rendered based on the package "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Algunos packages proporcionar personalizado configuración forms definido "
"por plugin providers. Estos forms son dinámicamente rendered basado en el"
" package tipo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:56
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:58
msgid ""
"The package installation runs asynchronously. Progress can be monitored "
"in the cluster's History tab."
msgstr ""
"El package installation ejecuta asynchronously. Progress puede be "
"monitored en el cluster's Historial pestaña."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:61
msgid "Editing Package Configuration"
msgstr "Editing Package Configuration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:63
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:75
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:89
msgid "Navigate to the Cluster's **PACKAGES** tab"
msgstr "Navegue un el Cluster's **PACKAGES** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:64
msgid "Click the edit icon next to the installed package"
msgstr "Click el editar ícono siguiente al instalado package"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:65
msgid "Modify the configuration settings"
msgstr "Modify el configuración configuraciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:66
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:68
msgid "Configuration updates are applied asynchronously to the cluster nodes."
msgstr "Configuración actualiza son applied asynchronously al cluster nodos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:71
msgid "Upgrading a Package"
msgstr "Upgrading un Package"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:73
msgid ""
"When a newer version of an installed package is available, the package is"
" marked as upgradeable:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un newer versión de un instalado package está disponible, el "
"package es marked como upgradeable:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:76
msgid ""
"Click the upgrade icon next to the package (shown when an upgrade is "
"available)"
msgstr ""
"Click el actualización ícono siguiente al package (mostrado cuando un "
"actualización está disponible)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:77
msgid "Review the upgrade details:"
msgstr "Review el actualización details:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:79
msgid "**Current Version** — The version currently installed"
msgstr "**Current Version** — El versión actualmente instalado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:80
msgid "**Upgrade Version** — The version that will be installed"
msgstr "**Actualización Version** — El versión ese será be instalado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:82
msgid "Confirm the upgrade"
msgstr "Confirmar el actualización"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:84
msgid ""
"The upgrade runs asynchronously. The package status will update to "
"reflect the new version upon completion."
msgstr ""
"El actualización ejecuta asynchronously. El package estado será update a "
"reflect el nuevo versión upon completion."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:87
msgid "Removing a Package"
msgstr "Removing un Package"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:90
msgid "Click the delete icon next to the package"
msgstr "Click el eliminar ícono siguiente al package"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:91
msgid "Review the deletion confirmation showing the package name and description"
msgstr "Review el deletion confirmation showing el package nombre y descripción"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:92
msgid "Confirm the removal"
msgstr "Confirmar el removal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:94
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:94
msgid ""
"Removing a package will uninstall its components from all cluster nodes. "
"Ensure no workloads depend on the package's services before removing it."
msgstr ""
"Removing un package será uninstall su components desde todos cluster "
"nodos. Asegurar no cargas de trabajo depend en el package's servicios "
"antes de removing it."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:96
msgid ""
"Package removal runs asynchronously and is tracked in the cluster's "
"History tab."
msgstr ""
"Package removal ejecuta asynchronously y es tracked en el cluster's "
"Historial pestaña."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:99
msgid "Package Status Values"
msgstr "Package Estado Valores"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:101
msgid "**Installed** — Package is active and functioning normally"
msgstr "**Instalado** — Package está activo y functioning normally"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:102
msgid "**Installing** — Package installation is in progress"
msgstr "**Installing** — Package installation es en progress"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:103
msgid "**Upgrading** — Package upgrade is in progress"
msgstr "**Upgrading** — Package actualización es en progress"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:104
msgid "**Removing** — Package removal is in progress"
msgstr "**Removing** — Package removal es en progress"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/addon_packages.rst:105
msgid "**Error** — Package encountered an error during installation or operation"
msgstr "**Error** — Package encountered un error durante installation o operación"

